  "memorial_details": "A small concrete cairn with a metal plaque sat at the top. Concrete bricks make up the outer facade of the cairn; the centre of the cairn is solid concrete. This plaque details the names of the airmen who perished in the plane crash.",
  "inscription": "PLAQUE : In Memory of / Fg Off Thomas Lennox French/ WO Andrew McFadyen/ Flt Sgt Charles McGregor/ Flt Sgt John Robert Harper/ 1st Lt S Kaulis USAAC / Who tragically lost their lives when their aircraft, Vickers Wellington X3707, crashed at Craiglockhart View on14th December 1942.",
